---
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-content">
    <div class="hero-panel fade-in">
      <p class="hero-kicker">IA para firmas e in-house legal</p>
      <h1 class="hero-title">Práctica legal de alto rendimiento con <span>Argemus.</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">
        Analiza documentos, acelera due diligence, reduce fricción operativa y mejora la calidad jurídica con una experiencia diseñada para equipos exigentes.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <button class="cta-button primary">Solicitar Demo</button>
        <button class="cta-button secondary">Explorar plataforma</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 88vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding-top: 4.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    isolation: isolate;
  }

  .hero::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 8% 12% auto;
    height: 360px;
    z-index: -1;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: linear-gradient(130deg, rgba(116, 132, 218, 0.16), rgba(127, 146, 255, 0.03));
    filter: blur(18px);
  }

  .hero-panel {
    max-width: 900px;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 0;
    background: transparent;
  }

  .hero-content {
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .hero-kicker {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem;
    font-size: 0.73rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent-strong);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    line-height: 1.02;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .hero-title span {
    color: var(--color-accent-strong);
    animation: glowPulse 3s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.6rem;
    max-width: 700px;
  }

  .hero-cta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.72rem;
    animation: fadeIn 900ms ease both;
    animation-delay: 120ms;
  }

  .cta-button.secondary {
    background: rgba(21, 26, 39, 0.82);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .cta-button.secondary:hover {
    background: rgba(37, 43, 60, 0.92);
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .hero-kicker,
  .hero-title,
  .hero-subtitle {
    animation: fadeIn 700ms ease both;
  }

  .hero-title { animation-delay: 80ms; }
  .hero-subtitle { animation-delay: 160ms; }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero-cta {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }

  @keyframes glowPulse {
    0%, 100% { text-shadow: 0 0 0 rgba(184, 194, 255, 0); }
    50% { text-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(184, 194, 255, 0.26); }
  }
</style>
